  "notes": "Four independent mast pads (M1-M4) in zones Z1-Z4. Each pad: survey (50.3 m2) -> grade (50.3 m2) -> excavate (50.3 m3) -> compact (50.3 m2) -> inspect (50.3 m2). Only one robot per pad at a time. Two excavators and two compactors allow two pads in parallel for those phases. Single surveyor sequences survey/inspect across pads. Hauler not used. All tasks within battery limits (excavator ~1045 Wh/pad, compactor ~201 Wh/pad, surveyor ~200 Wh total). Horizon 144h well above critical path (~15h per pad sequential, ~30h with two excavators parallel)."
